{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/285802-online-mass-combat-simulator","id":285802,"title":"Online Mass Combat Simulator","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-18T03:37:03-07:00","id":285802,"title":"Online Mass Combat Simulator","content":"My brother is running an Exalted game sort-of online (they currently run over Skype, with three people local, one inter-state, and one inter-national player), and it's coming up to a climatic (probably) final battle. Given the difficulties of running mass combat over Skype, we were wondering if there was some program that we could use. Ideally it'd use a custom terrain, with all players able to see the armies, which can be moved, and communicate, either through voice or text.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the help!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T08:12:35-07:00","id":285932,"title":"","content":"Roll20 is the first thing to come to mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T19:52:00-07:00","id":286332,"title":"","content":"Looks potentially good, but would it work for Exalted Mass Combat? We don't need it to calculate dice rolls and enforce rules or anything, that can be done by the ST and players, but it <i>appears</i> as if you need a ruleset, which means we'll have problems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mSW2-p-SwmYw5gaqnVMQ7HcRNhVedC-aA4vB6sBclGk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for GMs</a> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hslzrmui6ML-v7LniQUXLNyy8o52YF9g2u6usdu-Drc/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Commandments for Players</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/207-allan53","name":"Allan53","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"966"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-18T21:03:46-07:00","id":286366,"title":"","content":"with the note that I've not tried using it for such, only for google hangout based games, it should be doable. All I ever used it for is displaying a background/picture/map, but IIRC it has an overlay. So at worst the players would have to say &quot;I'm moving X unit to Y&quot; and the GM does it instead of the player. That's at worst, like I said, I've not used it for this functionality myself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{